{"comment_text": {"ja126:0.1": "", "ja126:0.2": "", "ja126:0.3": "", "ja126:0.4": "", "ja126:1.1": "This innocuous verse is wryly deadpan in the context of the rather outrageous slapstick of the origin story. ", "ja126:1.2": "", "ja126:1.3": "", "ja126:1.4": "", "ja126:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja126:0.1": "<article id='ja126'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja126:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja126:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja126:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja126:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja126:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja126:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja126:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja126:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja126:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja126:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja126:0.3": "Kusanāḷivagga ", "ja126:0.4": "6. Asilakkhaṇajātaka ", "ja126:1.1": "“Tadevekassa kalyāṇaṁ, ", "ja126:1.2": "tadevekassa pāpakaṁ; ", "ja126:1.3": "Tasmā sabbaṁ na kalyāṇaṁ, ", "ja126:1.4": "sabbaṁ vāpi na pāpakan”ti. ", "ja126:2.1": "Asilakkhaṇajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja126:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 126 ", "ja126:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja126:0.3": "The Reed-stalk Chapter ", "ja126:0.4": "The Mark On the Sword: a past life story ", "ja126:1.1": "That is good for some, ", "ja126:1.2": "ill for others. ", "ja126:1.3": "Therefore not all is good, ", "ja126:1.4": "nor is all ill. ", "ja126:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja126:0.1": "", "ja126:0.2": "", "ja126:0.3": "", "ja126:0.4": "", "ja126:1.1": "Tadevekassa → tathevekassa (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, mr, aṭṭhakathāyaṁ pāṭhantaraṁ); tatheva kassa (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja126:1.2": "", "ja126:1.3": "", "ja126:1.4": "", "ja126:2.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja126:0.1": "", "ja126:0.2": "", "ja126:0.3": "", "ja126:0.4": "", "ja126:1.1": "bj30.52, ms22J_279, msdiv126, pts-vp-pli1.458, sya27.41", "ja126:1.2": "", "ja126:1.3": "", "ja126:1.4": "", "